canon: EVIDENCE_ARGUMENT_CONFLICT: `--all-scenarios` is given, which cannot be given with `--scenario`, `--task`, `--report-case`, `--approver`, `--approval-role`, `--signature-file`, `--approval-at`
  field: --scenario
  hint: --all-scenarios writes one record per scenario its report owns, so it names no single subject. a working call: canon evidence add --scenario auth.login.01 --class test-run --ref "npm test" --role implementer; `canon schema evidence add --json` lists the constraints of the command
